WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.792
Is the shock you seem
to be displaying at present

00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:04.833
due to the fact
that I appear well-read

00:00:04.917 --> 00:00:05.875
and articulate?

00:00:06.583 --> 00:00:08.167
Or do you suffer from
some medical ailment

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.375
about which
I should be informed?

00:00:15.458 --> 00:00:16.875
What's your name?

00:00:18.708 --> 00:00:19.875
Eloise Bridgerton.

00:00:19.958 --> 00:00:21.083
Pleased to meet you,
Miss Eloise.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:22.958
I'm Theo Sharpe.

00:00:23.042 --> 00:00:24.167
I know.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:25.417
You know?

00:00:27.875 --> 00:00:30.250
As I know, there are several
errors in your arguments

00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:31.792
that I must bring
to your attention.

00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:33.083
Have you a pencil?

00:00:33.792 --> 00:00:35.375
Never mind.
You may borrow mine.

00:00:38.042 --> 00:00:39.125
Do not tell me
you've travelled

00:00:39.208 --> 00:00:40.375
at this ungodly hour

00:00:40.458 --> 00:00:42.125
to offer more corrections
of my writing.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.792
It was the only time I could
leave without being seen.

00:00:44.875 --> 00:00:46.042
And on the contrary,

00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:48.458
I've come to ask
for your discernment.

00:00:48.542 --> 00:00:51.083
-Is that so?
-Do not look so pleased.

00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:54.000
It is a rare occurrence that
I doubt shall be repeated.

00:00:55.417 --> 00:00:56.333
I have questions

00:00:56.417 --> 00:00:58.208
about the writings
in this pamphlet.

00:00:58.292 --> 00:01:01.208
Well, the ideas
can tax a fragile mind.

00:01:01.292 --> 00:01:02.875
Perhaps your means
of communicating them

00:01:02.958 --> 00:01:04.667
leaves much to be desired.

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:06.875
Or perhaps you
have not seen enough

00:01:06.958 --> 00:01:08.542
of the world
to make sense of them yet.

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:10.708
What of Lady Whistledown?

00:01:10.792 --> 00:01:12.208
She speaks on everyone
without remorse.

00:01:12.292 --> 00:01:14.042
No, no,
she does not speak of all.

00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:15.833
Perhaps she simply
does not know

00:01:15.917 --> 00:01:17.208
that there are some
beyond the ton

00:01:17.292 --> 00:01:18.583
worthy of attention too.

00:01:18.667 --> 00:01:20.625
Why are you speaking
of Mr. Sharpe again, El?

00:01:20.708 --> 00:01:22.250
I have heeded your warnings.

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:24.042
Theoretically.

00:01:25.708 --> 00:01:27.458
It would be foolish of me
to continue to visit him.

00:01:27.542 --> 00:01:29.167
And what in actuality?

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:32.667
I visited him
just the other day,

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:33.833
but it's not nearly
as scandalous

00:01:33.917 --> 00:01:35.042
as you make it out to be.

00:01:35.125 --> 00:01:36.625
It is only his thoughts
I am interested in.

00:01:36.708 --> 00:01:38.000
It is a friendship then?

00:01:38.083 --> 00:01:39.083
Of course.

00:01:40.083 --> 00:01:41.417
What else could it be?

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.417
You have come quite a long
way to ask me something,

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:45.583
so go on.

00:01:47.208 --> 00:01:48.417
I have thoughts.

00:01:49.958 --> 00:01:51.375
I can see how that
might pose a problem

00:01:51.458 --> 00:01:52.625
for someone in your world.

00:01:52.708 --> 00:01:54.083
Thoughts I would
like to share…

00:01:54.667 --> 00:01:55.917
with you.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.583
And are you not
sharing them now?

00:01:57.667 --> 00:02:01.375
What I am failing
to say is that often

00:02:02.417 --> 00:02:04.042
when I read
something new or…

00:02:05.375 --> 00:02:07.292
interesting or provoking,

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:10.583
it is you
who crosses my mind.

00:02:11.292 --> 00:02:13.500
It is you I would like
to speak with

00:02:13.583 --> 00:02:15.042
about those thoughts.

00:02:19.458 --> 00:02:20.625
I see.

00:02:23.083 --> 00:02:25.208
And so I am wondering if…

00:02:25.917 --> 00:02:28.625
you might also
have thoughts of me

00:02:28.708 --> 00:02:29.708
when you think.

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:33.083
I've read all of these.

00:02:35.875 --> 00:02:36.792
And?

00:02:37.667 --> 00:02:38.667
And…

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:41.917
I set them aside for you.

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:46.542
I thought… perhaps you might

00:02:47.292 --> 00:02:48.542
share your thoughts on them.

00:02:55.458 --> 00:02:58.000
People from the palace
have been asking about me.

00:02:58.083 --> 00:02:59.417
I was almost
thrown out today.

00:03:00.667 --> 00:03:02.958
Yes, I think
that may be my fault.

00:03:03.042 --> 00:03:05.542
The Queen, she… she saw me
visiting you the other day

00:03:05.625 --> 00:03:08.042
and now believes me to be
Lady Whistledown herself.

00:03:08.125 --> 00:03:09.500
Ridiculous, yes?

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:11.792
What is ridiculous
is the fact

00:03:11.875 --> 00:03:14.042
that you thought it wise
to come back here again.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.208
Come for more books,
did you?

00:03:17.875 --> 00:03:18.875
What?

00:03:19.458 --> 00:03:20.917
No, I…

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.625
came to make sure
you were alright,

00:03:22.708 --> 00:03:24.417
to get our story straight.

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:25.708
Our story?

00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:31.625
This is not the least
bit surprising.

00:03:32.875 --> 00:03:33.875
What is that supposed
to mean?

00:03:33.958 --> 00:03:35.792
It means that you are a lady
who has never had to endure

00:03:35.875 --> 00:03:37.958
any real difficulties
in your life.

00:03:38.958 --> 00:03:40.750
You may have the protection
of your family,

00:03:40.833 --> 00:03:42.417
of your society, but I'm…

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:45.917
I do not.

00:03:47.458 --> 00:03:49.375
You have taken pleasure from
low life, Miss Bridgerton.

00:03:49.458 --> 00:03:51.167
Now I think it best
you return to Mayfair

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:52.792
before you get me
into any more trouble.

00:04:17.208 --> 00:04:18.125
You got my note?

00:04:18.792 --> 00:04:20.625
Why did you not
tell me sooner?

00:04:21.542 --> 00:04:23.292
Why did you continue
lying to me,

00:04:23.375 --> 00:04:24.292
carrying on with me

00:04:24.375 --> 00:04:26.083
when you knew
this entire time

00:04:26.167 --> 00:04:27.167
that the real
Lady Whistledown

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.542
has been using
this very shop

00:04:28.625 --> 00:04:29.792
to print her scandal sheet.

00:04:29.875 --> 00:04:30.917
I couldn't tell you.

00:04:31.833 --> 00:04:33.375
Not when she was
still watching me.

00:04:34.417 --> 00:04:36.083
Why do you think I ended
things how I did with you

00:04:36.167 --> 00:04:37.750
despite wanting to do
the very opposite?

00:04:39.333 --> 00:04:41.208
I did not want her to see
the two of us together.

00:04:41.292 --> 00:04:43.083
I did not want her
to write cruelly of you.

00:04:43.167 --> 00:04:44.417
Little late for that.

00:04:50.167 --> 00:04:51.833
I owe you an apology,
Miss Bridgerton…

00:04:53.792 --> 00:04:55.042
for everything.

00:04:55.125 --> 00:04:57.542
Whistledown's now taken
her business elsewhere.

00:04:57.625 --> 00:04:58.917
Thought you'd deserve
to know the truth.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:00.167
I deserve more than that.

00:05:06.417 --> 00:05:07.417
Forgive me.

00:05:08.083 --> 00:05:09.083
I'm…

00:05:15.333 --> 00:05:16.250
This is absurd.

00:05:19.208 --> 00:05:20.167
I would never…

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:22.708
This whole thing,
it is absurd. I…

00:05:24.625 --> 00:05:26.333
We cannot continue
to meet like this.

00:05:26.417 --> 00:05:27.542
This was your idea.

00:05:27.625 --> 00:05:28.708
I know. I…

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:31.000
I know it was.

00:05:31.083 --> 00:05:34.625
And… and I'm sorry
for wasting your time.

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:36.250
Are you?

00:05:37.625 --> 00:05:38.958
Or are you suddenly
dropping out of this hunt

00:05:39.042 --> 00:05:39.875
for other reasons?

00:05:41.167 --> 00:05:43.167
People are already
talking about us, Theo.

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:46.833
I do not normally care what
other people think, but yes,

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:48.958
I care about you.

00:05:50.042 --> 00:05:52.042
And if we continue
on like this…

00:05:52.792 --> 00:05:54.000
I could not live with myself

00:05:54.083 --> 00:05:56.083
if you are the one who has
to face the consequences.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:58.750
I should have known…

00:06:00.875 --> 00:06:02.167
that you could not
be any different

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.000
from all the other ladies.

00:06:05.917 --> 00:06:07.458
It's alright,
Miss Bridgerton.

00:06:08.125 --> 00:06:09.875
You dipped your toe
into my waters,

00:06:09.958 --> 00:06:11.917
trying to make yourself
feel better

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.250
about the unearned
advantages of your birth.

00:06:16.792 --> 00:06:18.292
Now you can go
back to your life

00:06:19.167 --> 00:06:20.917
and I can go back to mine.

00:06:28.792 --> 00:06:31.500
I'm sorry I couldn't
help you find your writer.

